Ravana honors helpers and dives to Rasatala ocean realm --- Ravana subdues Nagas at Bhogavati and reaches Manimati --- Ravana duels Nivatakavachas a full year undecided --- Brahma halts fight and binds friendship before Agni --- Ravana learns hundred sorceries and storms Ashmanagara --- Ravana slays four hundred Daityas and eyes Varuna abode --- Ravana circles Surabhi cow and enters Varuna palace --- Ministers rout Varuna troops while Mahodara wrecks sky chariots --- Ravana fells Varuna sons, learns Varuna absent and departs proclaiming
